or","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids, January to February and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 161% of normal in April to May and 34% in November to December. So far in 2026 it shows 49% in January to February and 119% in June to July. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grid 19044 at 49% that year.</p>"}
